{"seq":28,"slug":"ai-evaluation-benchmarks","title":"AI 评测与基准","stage":"DONE","category":"ai-llm","chapterCount":4,"docCount":14,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks","rating":{"composite":4.01,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4.4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4.5,"strategic":3.67},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.54,"verdict":"consider","uScore":4.25}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"ai-评测与基准-简介\">AI 评测与基准 简介</h1><p>AI 评测与基准是衡量人工智能系统能力、可靠性和安全性的核心方法论体系。随着大语言模型和多模态模型的快速迭代，建立科学、全面、可复现的评测体系已成为模型选型、模型改进和模型治理的基础能力。本知识库系统梳理 AI 评测的理论基础、主流基准测试和工程实践，帮助读者构建面向实际场景的评测能力。</p>\n<p>本知识库适用于关注模型质量的中高级开发者，包括负责模型选型的技术架构师、负责模型改进的机器学习工程师、关注模型安全的 AI 治理人员，以及需要构建领域评测体系的垂直行业技术团队。</p>\n<p>全书共分为四章，从评测基础理论到安全评测形成完整闭环。</p>\n<p>第一章<strong>评测基础</strong>，建立评测的方法论基础，涵盖评测原则的设计、核心指标类型的分类与选择，以及人工评测的组织方法与质量控制，帮助读者掌握评测工作的底层逻辑。</p>\n<p>第二章<strong>基准测试全景</strong>，系统梳理当前主流的 AI 基准测试体系，涵盖语言理解、推理能力、编码能力、多模态能力与 Agentic 能力五个维度的核心基准，帮助读者快速了解评测领域的整体版图。</p>\n<p>第三章<strong>自定义评测</strong>，聚焦如何为特定业务场景构建定制化评测体系，涵盖评测框架的架构设计、领域评测的实施方法和自动化评测管线的构建，帮助读者将通用评测能力转化为业务价值。</p>\n<p>第四章<strong>安全评测</strong>，围绕 AI 系统的安全性和鲁棒性展开，涵盖红队测试、偏见检测和鲁棒性测试三大核心方法，帮助读者建立面向生产环境的安全评测能力。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先通过第一章建立评测方法论基础，再通过第二章了解主流基准测试的全景，之后通过第三章学习如何构建自定义评测体系，最后通过第四章完善安全评测能力。已有评测经验的读者可根据需求直接选读对应章节。</p>\n<h2 id=\"与邻近-hub-的边界\">与邻近 hub 的边界</h2><p>「评测」一词在多个兄弟 hub 中出现，分工如下，避免在错的地方找错的内容：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>本 hub 讲<strong>评测的通用方法论与基准全景</strong>——指标怎么设计、分数怎么解读、业界有哪些基准、各自水位如何。</li>\n<li><strong>AI 产品评测与红队</strong>（<a href=\"../ai-evaluation-redteam/\">../33_ai-evaluation-redteam/_INTRODUCTION.md</a>）讲 AI 产品工程化视角：评测集构建流水线、标注平台选型、红队对抗的组织与工具链。要&quot;给产品搭评测体系&quot;，去那边；要&quot;看懂基准与分数&quot;，留在这边。</li>\n<li><strong>LLM 应用评测与可观测性</strong>（<a href=\"../llm-app-eval-observability/\">../37_llm-app-eval-observability/_INTRODUCTION.md</a>）讲线上侧：golden 数据集回归、LLM-as-judge 工程化、全链路追踪与漂移监控。本 hub 的第三章给它的判定方法打底，它负责把方法落进生产闭环。</li>\n<li><strong>AI 安全与对齐</strong>（<a href=\"../ai-safety-alignment/\">../13_ai-safety-alignment/_INTRODUCTION.md</a>）讲对齐训练与安全技术本身；本 hub 第四章只从<strong>评测视角</strong>覆盖安全能力怎么测（红队测试方法、偏见与鲁棒性度量），不展开对齐算法。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>一句话定位：本 hub 是「评测这门学科」的地图——方法论 + 基准水位表；产品工程、线上可观测、对齐技术分别由上述三个 hub 深入。</p>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读\">延伸阅读</h2><ul>\n<li>推理模型与测试时计算范式（理解第二章推理基准代际跃迁的技术背景）：<a href=\"../llm-reasoning-test-time-compute/\">大模型推理与测试时计算</a></li>\n<li>把评测结论落回模型训练环节（RLHF/DPO 与偏好优化）：<a href=\"../rlhf-preference-alignment/\">RLHF 与偏好对齐微调</a></li>\n</ul>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evaluation-fundamentals","title":"评测基础","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/evaluation-fundamentals","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"evaluation-principles","title":"AI 评估原则","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/evaluation-fundamentals/evaluation-principles"},{"seq":2,"slug":"metric-types","title":"评估指标体系","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/evaluation-fundamentals/metric-types"},{"seq":3,"slug":"human-evaluation","title":"人工评估方法论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/evaluation-fundamentals/human-evaluation"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"benchmark-landscape","title":"基准测试全景","docCount":5,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"language-benchmarks","title":"语言能力基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape/language-benchmarks"},{"seq":2,"slug":"reasoning-benchmarks","title":"推理能力基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape/reasoning-benchmarks"},{"seq":3,"slug":"coding-benchmarks","title":"代码能力基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape/coding-benchmarks"},{"seq":4,"slug":"multimodal-benchmarks","title":"多模态评估基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape/multimodal-benchmarks"},{"seq":5,"slug":"agentic-benchmarks","title":"Agentic 能力基准","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/benchmark-landscape/agentic-benchmarks"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"custom-evaluation","title":"自定义评测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"eval-framework-design","title":"评估框架设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/eval-framework-design"},{"seq":2,"slug":"domain-specific-eval","title":"领域专项评估","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/domain-specific-eval"},{"seq":3,"slug":"automated-evaluation","title":"自动化评估流水线","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/custom-evaluation/automated-evaluation"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"safety-evaluation","title":"安全评测","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/safety-evaluation","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"red-teaming","title":"红队测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/safety-evaluation/red-teaming"},{"seq":2,"slug":"bias-detection","title":"偏见检测","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/safety-evaluation/bias-detection"},{"seq":3,"slug":"robustness-testing","title":"鲁棒性测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/ai-evaluation-benchmarks/safety-evaluation/robustness-testing"}]}]}